{"parse": {"title": "死生对位-06", "pageid": 134867, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%AD%BB%E7%94%9F%E5%AF%B9%E4%BD%8D-05\" title=\"死生对位-05\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">死生对位-06</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%AD%BB%E7%94%9F%E5%AF%B9%E4%BD%8D-07\" title=\"死生对位-07\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">死生对位</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">06</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E6.9A.97.E6.98.A7.E7.8C.9C.E6.83.B3.EF.BC.8C.E5.88.87.E5.AE.9E.E8.AF.81.E6.98.8E\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"暗昧猜想，切实证明\">暗昧猜想，切实证明</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 暗昧猜想，切实证明</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Conjecture and Proof</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-bangongshihunan.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"bangongshihunan\"><img alt=\"bangongshihunan\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/Cg-bangongshihunan.png/600px-Cg-bangongshihunan.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/Cg-bangongshihunan.png/900px-Cg-bangongshihunan.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/Cg-bangongshihunan.png/1200px-Cg-bangongshihunan.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>蕾切尔，你疯了吗？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>你没受过专业深潜训练，我们带的潜水服也不适用于这种深度。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>没有必要为了一次观测冒这么大的险！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蕾切尔：</div><div>不过是水下二十多米而已……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>是三十六米……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蕾切尔：</div><div>这支测控计真的非常重要。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蕾切尔：</div><div>它是唯一一支观测到异常数据的仪器，如果不能回收本体，我们这次的观测就失去了意义。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>这只是第一次野外考察，我们设备不全，一切都只是刚刚起步。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>我们的记录仪也清楚记录下了测控计传回来的数据，哪怕没有本体也足够了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>别下水去送死行吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蕾切尔：</div><div>别装傻了，黑墙。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蕾切尔：</div><div>我们都知道远程读数实在是太不稳定了。我们必须回收本体，和基准测控计对比校准，否则就是孤证不立。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>但……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她想打断蕾切尔，但正忙于套上潜水服的女性还在继续自己的絮叨。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蕾切尔：</div><div>否则，我们的数据分析就只是一种“猜想”，或者不切实际的“想象”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蕾切尔：</div><div>就算是你们剑桥的哈代或者拉马努金，照样得给自己的猜想和公式做证明过程。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蕾切尔：</div><div>我必须切实地向所有人证明。我要保证消除每一丝合理的怀疑，我需要这个无可辩驳的物证。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>“科学需要听到的是完整的故事，而不是一声疯狂的啼鸣。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蕾切尔：</div><div>哈，我喜欢这句话！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>蕾切尔！现在不是说这种话的时候。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>这支测控计可能只是故障了。况且我们这次的准备非常仓促，我们完全可以等到下一次行动计划更完善……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蕾切尔：</div><div>我们不一定还会遇到这样的数据，即便它只是一个故障数据，我也需要验证真伪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>蕾切尔的目光变得柔和。她看着玛格丽特。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蕾切尔：</div><div>你一定明白我吧？玛格丽特，我等得已经够久了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛格丽特并不回答，她沉默如明镜，蕾切尔似乎能对着她，看清自己内心的愿景。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蕾切尔：</div><div>我的人生是为了科学而存在的，它是我认识世界、连接世界的方法。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蕾切尔：</div><div>整个科学史上群星璀璨，现代世界构建在科学史之上。我们经历十几个世纪，终于将占星术和天文学分开，远离了蒙昧的时代。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蕾切尔：</div><div>然后“暴雨”来了……现在一切回到了起点。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>蕾切尔……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>蕾切尔抬起头，询问使她变得一无所有的暗昧命运。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蕾切尔：</div><div>那些会聚在学会里，以毕生去猜想和证明世界规律的天才们算什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蕾切尔：</div><div>在漫长岁月中，为求真理与蒙昧斗争的牺牲者又算什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蕾切尔：</div><div>我的人生……所有人类的人生，整个科学史的发展，不应该被“暴雨”夺走。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蕾切尔：</div><div>我需要证明它还存在，我需要证明这一切。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>你说的这些我们都明白，但是活着才有可能性——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蕾切尔：</div><div>别再说了，黑墙研究员。我恳请你尊重我作为研究员的决心。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她倏然打断黑墙。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>这就是你真正的决定吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蕾切尔：</div><div>哈哈……对的，真正的决定。从第一次“暴雨”后，我迷失至今。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蕾切尔：</div><div>是的，这是命运和第一因赋予我的职责，是我找到自己存在的最后机会。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>好，那我不会再阻拦你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>等等，等等……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>痛苦的气息在黑墙的大脑深处突然爆炸、弥漫。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她想起安妮淹没在影子里的面孔，而这一切又是如此熟悉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>蕾切尔，你不认为这一切都很奇怪吗？这一切都太巧合了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>数据是可以伪造的，就像测控计是人为制造的，这就像一个他人编写的剧本，引导着你寻求解脱……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蕾切尔：</div><div>什么剧本？黑墙，你是在质疑我对于科学的责任心吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蕾切尔：</div><div>还是说，你在怀疑玛格丽特？开什么玩笑？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蕾切尔：</div><div>黑墙研究员，我不知道剑桥时期到底发生了什么，但你不能在这里大放厥词！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蕾切尔：</div><div>只用语言污蔑是最简单的事情！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>不，我……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一时冲动的语言使她后悔不已。她只有直觉，没有证据。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>你希望证明科学可以研究“暴雨”，结果这条路真的摆在了你的面前，我是说——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蕾切尔：</div><div>够了，黑墙。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蕾切尔：</div><div>到头来，只有玛格丽特一直理解我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蕾切尔：</div><div>……算了，没什么好说的了，我该下水去取回测控计了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_5_bg_24.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_5_bg_24\"><img alt=\"3_5_bg_24\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/Cg-3_5_bg_24.png/600px-Cg-3_5_bg_24.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/Cg-3_5_bg_24.png/900px-Cg-3_5_bg_24.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/Cg-3_5_bg_24.png/1200px-Cg-3_5_bg_24.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蕾切尔：</div><div>玛格丽特。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛格丽特快步跟上蕾切尔的脚步。夜色即将降临，她们并肩走在沙滩上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>海风中当然闻不出“暴雨”的气息，有的只是大自然的寂静。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>嗯？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蕾切尔：</div><div>《全球环境与局部混沌能量的变化路径采样》这篇论文是你写的吧？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛格丽特停住脚步。她们对视须臾。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蕾切尔：</div><div>写出那篇论文的人是一个不可多得的天才，她的叙述方法和平时的“玛格丽特”大相径庭。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蕾切尔：</div><div>但你们统计数据时的一些小习惯非常类似……很遗憾你平时只给环流观测小组做一些整理的工作，不然我一定会发现更多的共同点。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蕾切尔：</div><div>洛伦兹蝴蝶是个很好的笔名。我喜欢它代表的意象。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛伦兹蝴蝶：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>第一次，苍白研究员的笑容产生了一些角度上的变化。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她露出了一个真正的笑容。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛伦兹蝴蝶：</div><div>是的，我是洛伦兹研究所的一员，我从不相信科技，也不相信科学能带我们解开“暴雨”的秘密。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛伦兹蝴蝶：</div><div>很抱歉，我们的理想背道而驰，蕾切尔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蕾切尔：</div><div>原来如此……在检查装置的时候，我曾发现，那支测控计里头有一个陌生的构件。想必是你在设计的时候加上的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蕾切尔：</div><div>能告诉我它的用途是什么吗，洛伦兹蝴蝶？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛伦兹蝴蝶：</div><div>那是一个监测混沌能量的构件。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛伦兹蝴蝶：</div><div>你应该能理解，按照环流观测小组的外勤安全条例，最极限的情况是，我们必须在“暴雨”前一个半小时撤离，这是多方妥协的结果。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蕾切尔：</div><div>哈哈，我明白了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蕾切尔：</div><div>提早回收会导致观测效果大打折扣，无论是我的还是你的测控计。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛伦兹蝴蝶：</div><div>如果你能在恰当的时间将它带回来，我会非常感谢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蕾切尔：</div><div>你的意思是，“暴雨”来临的前一刻。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蕾切尔：</div><div>我现在有些好奇了，这水下究竟有什么在等着我，会让我耽误这么久？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛伦兹蝴蝶：</div><div>别担心，我为你准备了足够的氧气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蕾切尔：</div><div>那不如在论文上署上我的名字？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的玩笑依然不痛不痒，和她的声音一起缓慢落地。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛伦兹蝴蝶：</div><div>你的贡献没有这么大，蕾切尔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蕾切尔：</div><div>好吧，毕竟这可是个要命的任务呢……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蕾切尔：</div><div>但不重要了，玛格丽特。无数次，你都坚定地、无条件地站在我这边。而我也一样会坚定地站在你这边。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蕾切尔：</div><div>再见，我亲爱的玛格丽特。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那坦途就在面前，她一刻也不愿再等待。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "死生对位-06"}}